  "offscreen": {
    "description": "UI tests run offscreen and in parallel lanes through the sibling zforge-xcuitest-sim tool (RNF-Q08), except the realOnly ones, which leave the app process and take over the screen. durations are approximate simulated seconds used only to balance the lanes.",
